  "description": "Runs the partner subscription and advertisement lifecycle daily: grace-period/overdue policy, cancellation effective dates, scheduled tier/price changes and campaign start/end transitions. Runs on the backend \u2014 never only when a page is opened \u2014 and is guarded so the same day is never processed twice.",
